#face-image: img/portraits/MierendorffCarlo.jpg

= Ramón González Peña

González Peña is the leader of the Asturian miners' union and a champion of the <span style="color: #c00000;">Alianza Obrera</span> - a united front of workers' organizations to meet the fascist and authoritarian right in the streets as well as at the ballot box.

- @iron_front_buildup
- @form_iron_front
- @nazi_urgency
- @root: Return to main

@iron_front_buildup
title: Build up the <span style="color: #c00000;">Alianza Obrera</span>
subtitle: Step up recruitment into the worker militias.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if iron_front_formed == 0 : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Alianza Obrera</span> has not yet been formed. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; ugt_militia_strength += 200*(industrial_psoe_normalized / 100);

We have recruited more workers into the militias of the Alianza Obrera.


@form_iron_front
title: Forming the <span style="color: #c00000;">Alianza Obrera</span>
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed == 0 and nazi_urgency >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if iron_front_formed : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Alianza Obrera</span> has already been formed. ?][? if nazi_urgency < 2 : The party does not yet see the danger of the fascist right. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; ugt_militia_strength += 50; nazi_urgency += 1
go-to: confronting_nazis.iron_front


@nazi_urgency
title: Warning about the fascist right
subtitle: By warning the party about the fascist danger, we can spur our members to action.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nazi_urgency += 1; ugt_militia_militancy += 0.01; industrial_falange -= 4*(1-dissent);

We have begun a campaign to warn our members away from the false appeals of the far right.
